Third-party icons in sprite.svg
===============================

The brand leaf (i-leaf-brand) and favicon.svg are git-nd's own and follow the
project's license. Everything else in sprite.svg is vendored, unmodified apart
from being wrapped in <symbol> elements:

- Lucide v0.460.0 (https://lucide.dev) — ISC License, text below.
- Simple Icons v13.21.0 (https://simpleicons.org), i-github and i-gitlab only —
  CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication). GitHub and GitLab are
  trademarks of their owners; the marks only identify those providers.


